            'Start with the points and games played, then look at goal difference, which shows how convincingly a club has been winning. A big gap between goals scored and goals conceded usually means a club is doing well, and a negative goal difference near the bottom is a warning sign. Finally, look at the form column to see who is improving or slipping.',
