            'When you see a line-up written as 4-3-3 or 4-4-2, the numbers describe how a team spreads its ten outfield players across the pitch. The goalkeeper is not counted. Formations are the shape of a team, and understanding them makes it much easier to follow what a coach is trying to do.',
            '## Reading the numbers',
