            "Nigeria's women's national team, the Super Falcons, is the most successful team in African women's football. This guide covers the basics for new fans: how the team has performed, what the main competitions are and where to follow women's football.",
            '## The Super Falcons',
            "The Super Falcons are Nigeria's senior women's national team. They have won the Women's Africa Cup of Nations, known as WAFCON, more times than any other country, and they are a regular at the continent's top level. Nigeria has also appeared at the FIFA Women's World Cup in every edition through 2023, making it the only African team to have played at every one.",
